<td style="width: 100%; height: 15px; border-color: #f7f7f7; text-align: left;">
<h3 style="font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: normal; font-stretch: condensed; padding-left: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px; color: #233250; text-align: center;"><strong>BEFORE &amp; AFTER YOUR TRIP</strong></h3>
</td>
</tr>
