<div id="wifi-entertainment" style="padding-top: 35px;"></div>
<table border="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ffffff;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #233250; height: 15px;">
<td style="width: 100%; height: 15px; border-color: #ffffff; text-align: left;">
<h3 style="letter-spacing: normal; font-stretch: condensed; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; color: #ffffff;"><strong>WIFI &amp; ENTERTAINMENT</strong></h3>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 20px;"></div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Is WiFi available on every bus?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">WiFi is available on East Coast services and in Telstra coverage areas.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>How do I connect to the WiFi on the Greyhound bus?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">To connect to the WiFi on our coaches simply follow the following steps:</p>
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Select GreyhoundWiFi from the list of available networks.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Tick the “I accept the terms of use” checkbox when your browser automatically launches and then select Connect. Note: on some devices, the browser might not launch automatically, this you may be presented with a security warning prior to seeing this screen. In this case, accept the terms of use within your browser to access the connect screen for Greyhound WiFi.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>


                                    
    
<div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 15px;"><a data-id="1450" href="/travel-information/faq#top" title="Greyhound Australia" class="btn btn-cta-secondary"><span>Top of page</span></a></div>


                        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-grid
                                       row-padding content                                       " class="row-padding">

                        <div class="d-col-3 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-col-9 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                                    
    
<div id="travel-assistance" style="padding-top: 35px;"></div>
<table border="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ffffff;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #233250; height: 15px;">
<td style="width: 100%; height: 15px; border-color: #ffffff; text-align: left;">
<h3 style="letter-spacing: normal; font-stretch: condensed; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; color: #ffffff;"><strong>TRAVEL ASSISTANCE</strong></h3>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 20px;"></div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>I require assistance when I travel. What should I do?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">Passengers requiring travel assistance are requested to contact Greyhound’s Customer Service team on <a href="tel:1300473946">1300 473 946</a> to discuss your arrangements prior to departure. If you are not able to travel without requiring assistance, a Carer, Personal Assistant or Chaperone will be required to accompany you on your travel. A discounted fare is available for the accompanying passenger. See our <a href="/travel-information/travel-assistance">Travel Assistance policy</a> for more information.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Does Greyhound Australia offer easy access services?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">Greyhound Australia is progressively rolling out new ‘Easy Access’ coaches onto nominated services throughout the Greyhound network. The ‘Easy Access’ coach offers a lift to enable mobility-impaired passengers to access and exit the coach. Please see our <a data-udi="umb://document/cd4faef0e96f43218ebabc1c3caf2395" href="/travel-information/travel-assistance/easy-access-services" title="Easy Access Services FAQs">easy access services FAQs</a> for more information. </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>


                                    
    
<div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 15px;"><a data-id="1450" href="/travel-information/faq#top" title="Greyhound Australia" class="btn btn-cta-secondary"><span>Top of page</span></a></div>


                        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-grid
                                       row-padding content                                       " class="row-padding">

                        <div class="d-col-3 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-col-9 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                                    
    
<div id="disruptions" style="padding-top: 35px;"></div>
<table border="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ffffff;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #233250; height: 15px;">
<td style="width: 100%; height: 15px; border-color: #ffffff; text-align: left;">
<h3 style="letter-spacing: normal; font-stretch: condensed; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; color: #ffffff;"><strong>NATURAL DISASTER DISRUPTIONS</strong></h3>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 20px;"></div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Why might my service be disrupted?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">Natural disasters such as floods, bushfires, or cyclones can make roads unsafe or impassable. These events are beyond Greyhound's control and may cause delays, diversions, or cancellations.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 15px; text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;"><strong>Quick Tips</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Keep your contact details up to date.</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Consider travel insurance for unexpected events.</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Check our <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="/travel-information/service-updates" title="Service Updates">website</a> and <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://linktr.ee/greyhoundsocials" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social channels</a> for real-time updates.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>What happens if the road is closed or the bus is cancelled?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">We'll notify you as soon as possible.</li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">If you're stranded enroute, you can return to your departure point and travel later at no extra cost.</li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Your ticket will remain open-dated for 12 months.</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top: 15px; text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;"><strong>Quick Tips</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Keep your contact details up to date.</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Consider travel insurance for unexpected events.</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Check our <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="/travel-information/service-updates" title="Service Updates">website</a> and <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://linktr.ee/greyhoundsocials" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social channels</a> for real-time updates.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Will Greyhound refund my ticket?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">If Greyhound cancels a service for reasons within our control, we may offer a refund at our discretion.</li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">If the cancellation is due to a natural disaster or circumstances beyond our control, refunds are not guaranteed. Instead:
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Your ticket stays valid for 12 months.</li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">You may claim unused travel through your travel insurance.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">For certain packages, if cancelled due to a natural disaster, you can choose:
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">An alternative date, or</li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">A refund less a 10% cancellation fee.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Does Greyhound cover extra costs like accommodation or meals?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">No. Greyhound does not cover any additional expenses caused by delays or cancellations beyond our control.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>How will I be informed of changes?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">We'll contact you via the details provided at booking. For faster updates, make sure your mobile number and email are correct.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 15px; text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;"><strong>Quick Tips</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Keep your contact details up to date.</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Consider travel insurance for unexpected events.</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; margin-top: 3px;">Check our <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="/travel-information/service-updates" title="Service Updates">website</a> and <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://linktr.ee/greyhoundsocials" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social channels</a> for real-time updates.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>What if I don't want to travel after a disruption notice?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">If you're notified before boarding and choose to cancel, you can request a refund under our standard refund policy.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Do I need to sign anything?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">In some cases, you may be asked to sign a Natural Disaster Declaration Form acknowledging the risks of traveling during a declared event. This only occurs when there is a known risk and likelihood of impacts are acknowledged.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>


                                    
    
<div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 15px;"><a data-id="1450" href="/travel-information/faq#top" title="Greyhound Australia" class="btn btn-cta-secondary"><span>Top of page</span></a></div>


                        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-grid
                                       row-padding content                                       " class="row-padding">

                        <div class="d-col-3 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-col-9 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                                    
    
<div id="web-troubleshooting" style="padding-top: 35px;"></div>
<table border="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ffffff;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #233250; height: 15px;">
<td style="width: 100%; height: 15px; border-color: #ffffff; text-align: left;">
<h3 style="letter-spacing: normal; font-stretch: condensed; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; color: #ffffff;"><strong>WEB TROUBLESHOOTING</strong></h3>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 20px;"></div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>What do I do if my computer freezes up while I am in the middle of making a booking?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">If your computer freezes up while making a booking, don’t worry. Simply call our Call Centre on <a href="tel:1300473946">1300 473 946</a> and let them know what’s happening. Our team will be able to help you solve any problems regarding your booking.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>I am receiving an error message when trying to make a booking. What should I do?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">If you receive an error message that you cannot remedy or are concerned about, you can call our Call Centre on <a href="tel:1300473946">1300 473 946</a>. Our team of trained sales professionals will be able to help you to solve any problems involving your booking.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>


                                    
    
<div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 15px;"><a data-id="1450" href="/travel-information/faq#top" title="Greyhound Australia" class="btn btn-cta-secondary"><span>Top of page</span></a></div>


                        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-grid
                                       row-padding content                                       " class="row-padding">

                        <div class="d-col-3 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-col-9 t-col-6 m-col-12   " >
                                    
    
<div id="freight" style="padding-top: 35px;"></div>
<table border="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ffffff;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #233250; height: 15px;">
<td style="width: 100%; height: 15px; border-color: #ffffff; text-align: left;">
<h3 style="letter-spacing: normal; font-stretch: condensed; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; color: #ffffff;"><strong>FREIGHT &amp; PARCELS</strong></h3>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div style="padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 20px;"></div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>How can I send a parcel through Greyhound’s freight service?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">Greyhound Freight delivers over 220,000 parcels, care packages, commercial goods and more each year, from major capital cities and country towns to the most remote places in Australia. Get a quote and an estimated delivery time <a href="http://greyhoundfreight.com.au/booking.htm">online</a> or call <a href="tel:1300656532">1300 656 532</a> to arrange your freight consignment.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="experience-sections-container">
<div class="experience-element expand-on-click  parent-to-hide">
<div class="experience-info-details experience-title-wrapper c-header">
<div style="padding-bottom: 5px;">
<table border="1" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #d7d7d7; padding-top: 20px;">
<tbody>
<tr style="background-color: #f7f7f7; height: 30px;">
<td style="width: 85%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; border-style: none; text-align: left;">
<h4 style="color: #233250; padding-left: 15px;"><strong>Where does Greyhound Freight go?</strong></h4>
</td>
<td style="width: 15%; height: 30px; border-color: #ffffff; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 10px; border-style: none; text-align: right;"><img style="width: 25px; height: 25px;" src="/media/3599/down-arrow-icon-blue.png" alt="" data-udi="umb://media/9f15b5d91e224d92b8b3f2c93d0e1a33" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="experience-content c-header__body hide" style="border: none;">
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">Greyhound Freight is a freight distribution service which operates a national freight network providing daily scheduled services which connect metropolitan hubs with regional and remote communities.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">Greyhound Freight has capitalised on the available space within our Greyhound Passenger Coach network and combined this with our extensive network of Freight Depots and Authorised Greyhound Agents throughout Australia to enable us to provide a highly competitive road freight service.</p>
<p style="text-align: left; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px;">To find out more please contact our call centre on <a href="tel:1300656532">1300 656 532</a>, your local freight depot/agent or by using our <a href="http://greyhoundfreight.com.au/booking.htm">online quote/booking facility</a>. Visit the <a href="http://greyhoundfreight.com.au/">Greyhound Freight website</a> for more information on how to send or receive parcels through our freight network.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>


                                    
    
